pools.description:
Select remaining subjects as one of the following options;  
a) one major (24 credit points) and one elective; 
b) two majors (48 credit points); 
c) select three CSIT, CSCI or ISIT subjects at 300 level, one CSIT, CSCI or ISIT at 200/300 level and one elective subject from CSIT, CSCI, or ISIT or the General Schedule. 
Note that elective subjects are not in the core or chosen major.
